# card quantifier-values: all/any xs compared to a value, via AllOf and AnyOf
'all [1,2,3] < 5'	yes
'all [1,2,3] < 3'	no
'all [1,2,3] <= 3'	yes
'all [1,2,3] > 0'	yes
'all [1,2,3] >= 3'	no
'all [1,2,3] == 2'	no
'all [2,2,2] == 2'	yes
'all [1,2,3] != 0'	yes
'any [1,2,3] == 2'	yes
'any [1,2,3] == 5'	no
'any [1,2,3] != 2'	yes
'any [1,2,3] < 2'	yes
'any [1,2,3] > 3'	no
'any [1,2,3] <= 1'	yes
'any [1,2,3] >= 3'	yes
'xs = [1,2,3]; all xs < 5'	yes
'n = 5; all [1,2,3] < n'	yes
'ys = [1,2,3]; y = 2; any ys == y'	yes
'3 in all [1,2,3]'	error	unknown name all
'3 in any [1,2,3]'	error	unknown name any
'xs = [1,2]; ok = all xs > 0; ok'	yes
'xs = [1,-2]; if all xs > 0 {1} else {0}'	0
'xs = [1,2]; ok = any xs < 0; ok'	no
